{
  "title": "Fault finding: guard bypass",
  "level": "Diagnostics · Repair",
  "kind": "pack",
  "brief": "A faulty pusher program has already been loaded into the editor. Test it using the watch table and correct the program to meet the requirements below.",
  "requirements": [
    "An incorrect ladder program is already loaded. Auto Demand (I0.0) and Manual Demand (I0.1) are two ways to request a push. Station Ready (I0.2) is ON only when the station can operate.",
    "Pusher Extend (Q0.0) must be ON when Station Ready (I0.2) is ON AND at least one of Auto Demand (I0.0) or Manual Demand (I0.1) is ON.",
    "When both demand inputs are OFF, Pusher Extend (Q0.0) must be OFF.",
    "When Station Ready (I0.2) is OFF, Pusher Extend (Q0.0) must be OFF even if one or both demand inputs are ON.",
    "Use the watch table to find an input combination where the supplied program behaves incorrectly. Repair the ladder logic, then rerun the commissioning tests."
  ],
  "objective": "Diagnose a faulty control program using monitoring.",
  "ins": [
    {
      "a": "%I0.0",
      "n": "Auto_Demand",
      "d": false
    },
    {
      "a": "%I0.1",
      "n": "Manual_Demand",
      "d": false
    },
    {
      "a": "%I0.2",
      "n": "Station_Ready",
      "d": true
    }
  ],
  "outs": [
    {
      "a": "%Q0.0",
      "n": "Pusher_Extend",
      "d": false
    }
  ],
  "starter": [
    {
      "groups": [
        [
          [
            {
              "type": "NO",
              "a": "%I0.0"
            },
            {
              "type": "NO",
              "a": "%I0.2"
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "type": "NO",
              "a": "%I0.1"
            }
          ]
        ]
      ],
      "out": {
        "type": "COIL",
        "a": "%Q0.0",
        "p": 0,
        "r": "FALSE"
      },
      "name": "Faulty pusher command"
    }
  ],
  "hints": [
    "Try Manual Demand TRUE and Station Ready FALSE while monitoring.",
    "Station Ready must be in series with both alternative demand paths, not only one."
  ],
  "tests": [
    {
      "name": "Inputs 0 / 0 / 0",
      "steps": [
        {
          "in": {
            "%I0.0": false,
            "%I0.1": false,
            "%I0.2": false
          },
          "ms": 100,
          "expect": {
            "%Q0.0": false
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Inputs 1 / 0 / 0",
      "steps": [
        {
          "in": {
            "%I0.0": true,
            "%I0.1": false,
            "%I0.2": false
          },
          "ms": 100,
          "expect": {
            "%Q0.0": false
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Inputs 0 / 1 / 0",
      "steps": [
        {
          "in": {
            "%I0.0": false,
            "%I0.1": true,
            "%I0.2": false
          },
          "ms": 100,
          "expect": {
            "%Q0.0": false
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Inputs 1 / 1 / 0",
      "steps": [
        {
          "in": {
            "%I0.0": true,
            "%I0.1": true,
            "%I0.2": false
          },
          "ms": 100,
          "expect": {
